t-item font-ibm-plex-sans font-light !text-base md:!text-[1.15rem] !text-st=
one-200 not-first:mt-[1.25em] leading-7">AC-CHK-003.1: When payment process=
ing succeeds, the system shall display a confirmation page with the order n=
umber and estimated delivery date.</li><li class=3D"list-item font-ibm-plex=
